rience with third-party libraries that have hidden side effects.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Candidate</strong>: Grea=
t question! Side effects are probably the <strong>most misunderstood aspect=
</strong> of Tree Shaking, and third-party libraries are where this becomes=
 a real nightmare in production applications.</p>
